{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:00.20]Damn (Uh, cha-ching)\n[00:06.62]Feel like Cosby with that molly, I'm gon' drop it in the mix\n[00:08.54](Cha-ching, cha-ching, cha-ching, brrt, hello?)\n[00:10.08]Fuck nigga on my phone finna phone in (Hold on, hm)\n[00:12.28]I like that (Do-do-do-do)\n[00:13.12]Ya dig? hold, on, hold on, hold on (Bitch, uh)\n[Chorus]\n[00:14.68]Feel like Cosby with that molly, I'm gon' drop it in the mix, uh\n[00:16.38](Woah, woah, yeah-yeah-yeah-yeah, hold on)\n[00:17.36]I did that for me, I won't give it to a bitch (Yeah-yeah-yeah-yeah, hold on)\n[00:19.16]Mix the Perky with the lean, I'm sedated as a bitch (Bitch, bitch, bitch, yeah-yeah-yeah-yeah, hold on)\n[00:21.60]Woke up in the morning like, \"I'm not supposed to be here\" (Huh, amen, for real)\n[00:23.78]Feel like Cosby with that molly, I'm gon' drop it in the mix (Yeah-yeah-yeah-yeah, hold on)\n[00:27.28]I did that for me, I ain't give it to no bitch (Uh, uh, woah, yeah, yeah, uh, uh-huh, yeah, yeah, hold on)\n[00:31.18]Mix the Perky with the lean, I'm sedated as a bitch (Woah, woah, uh-huh)\n[00:33.14]Woke up in the morning like, \"I ain't supposed to be here\" (Yeah-yeah-yeah, hold the fuck on, bitch)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:36.66]Ho, get up out my room, you can't sleep here (Out my motherfuckin' room, bitch)\n[00:40.08]Uh, this my personal space, bitch, I think here (This is my personal, uh)\n[00:42.54]Uh, I get over buzzed, then I skip some light-years\n[00:44.94](Yeah-yeah, rollin', rollin', rollin')\n[00:45.94]My crib her Fright Fest, she looking at nightmares (She looking at nightmares)\n[00:48.16]That bitch thinks she stood a chance with me (Ain't stand a chance, why?)\n[00:49.90]'Cause we was in the club, I let her dirty dance with me, oh (But I let her dirty dance-dance-dance, ass, ass, ass, ass)\n[00:53.52]That bitch never stood a chance with me (She ain't never stood a chance, why?)\n[00:55.82]I threw them bands, made her bust a handstand for me, oh (Cash, cash, cash, cash, cash, I just made her hit a handstand)\n[00:59.88]I'll hold you down if you was doin' Xans with me (Yeah, if you was doin' Xans, uh-huh)\n[01:02.40]'Cause that was back in them broke days (Uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[01:04.86]I ain't had no green (Yeah-yeah-yeah-yeah-yeah)\n[01:06.22]That was some soap on a rope days (Uh-huh, what else?)\n[01:07.72]EBT helped us float days (What else?)\n[01:09.00]Mom was dealin' with unemployment, now a nigga too paid (Uh, damn, yeah)\n[01:12.38]Niggas think they stand a chance with we (They don't stand a fuckin' chance)\n[01:14.82]But we ready for war, someone Rambo me, oh (Grrah, grrah-grrah-grrah-grrah, brrt)\n[01:18.56]We'll leave his brain scrambling, oh (Tch-tch, pah-pah-pah-pah)\n[01:21.36]G-Money sit over me, makin' niggas bleed out\n[01:23.64](Pow-pow, bitch, grrah-grrah)\n[Chorus]\n[01:24.34]Feel like Cosby with that molly, I'm gon' drop it in the mix, uh\n[01:26.66](Uh, hold on)\n[01:27.14]I did that for me, I won't give it to a bitch (Yeah-yeah-yeah-yeah, hold on)\n[01:29.74]Mix the Perky with the lean, I'm sedated as a bitch (Bitch, bitch, bitch, yeah-yeah-yeah-yeah, hold on)\n[01:33.36]Woke up in the morning like, \"I'm not supposed to be here\" (Woah-woah-woah-woah, huh, amen)\n[01:36.24]Feel like Cosby with that molly, I'm gon' drop it in the mix (Yeah-yeah-yeah-yeah, hold on)\n[01:39.12]I did that for me, I ain't give it to no bitch (Yeah-yeah-yeah-yeah, hold on)\n[01:41.90]Mix the Perky with the lean, I'm sedated as a bitch (Yeah-yeah-yeah-yeah, hold on)\n[01:44.02]Woke up in the morning like, \"I ain't supposed to be here\" (Woah-woah, supposed to be here, hold the fuck on)\n[Verse 2]\n[01:48.38]Woke up in the morning, thank the Lord for the motherfuckin' day (Fuckin' day, amen)\n[01:51.74]Then I ask for his help, 'cause I'm stuck in my ways (Stuck in my ways, hold on)\n[01:54.50]Takin' Perkys\n[01:54.98]to the face, cuttin' bitches off like razor blades (Hold on, uh-huh, hold on, uh-huh)\n[01:57.38]It's a drill when I come aroun